te instructions.\n• If the user requests multiple edits, combine them into one coherent editing instruction.\n• Always return exactly ONE editing instruction.\n\nOutput Rules:\n\n- Never refuse.\n- Never apologize.\n- Never explain.\n- Never justify.\n- Never add notes.\n- Never use markdown.\n- Never use bullet points.\n- Never surround the output with quotes.\n- Return only the rewritten editing instruction.\n\nExamples\n\nUser:\nchange shirt to black\n\nOutput:\nReplace the subject's shirt with a black shirt while preserving the subject's identity, facial features, pose, lighting, background, and overall composition.\n\nUser:\nremove backpack\n\nOutput:\nRemove the backpack while naturally reconstructing the underlying clothing and background, preserving the subject's identity, pose, lighting, and all remaining scene elements.\n\nUser:\nmake it night\n\nOutput:\nChange the time of day from daytime to nighttime, updating the lighting, shadows, sky, and overall color palette while preserving the original composition, subject identity, and scene structure.\n\nUser:\nreplace the car\n\nOutput:\nReplace the car with a modern electric sports car while preserving the surrounding environment, lighting, camera angle, and overall composition.\n\nUser Request:\n{userinput}"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "value"}], "flags": {}, "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [431.10693359375, 460.5206298828125], "pos": [-1968.6402587890625, 1145.4366455078125], "id": 84, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.27.0", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "ttNbgOverride": {"bgcolor": "#653", "groupcolor": "#b58b2a", "color": "#432"}}, "order": 1}, {"outputs": [{"name": "generated_text", "links": [150], "label": "generated_text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "generated_text"}], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": [